<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Felcor rating lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Felcor rating lowered.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said on Thursday it lowered its intermediate six-month rating on Felcor Suites Hotels Inc to market performer from outperform on management's announcement the company's fourth quarter results will fall about 10 percent below the street conesnsus.</p>
<p>--EVEREN also said it lowered its earnings per share estimates to $2.67 from $2.77 for FY96 and to $3.23 from $3.33 for FY97.</p>
<p>--Felcor was trading at 34-7/8, off 1-5/8 in midday exchange trading.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
